"┌ help ────────────────────────────────┐"
"│ Ctrl-] then a key:                   │"
"│   n  summon          b  banish       │"
"│   r  recall          c  cast         │"
"│   x  close           t  timetable    │"
"│   q  quit            ?  help         │"
"│   m  mouse capture   d  detach       │"
"│   1-9  focus that slot               │"
"│   Ctrl-]  a literal Ctrl-]           │"
"│ [close esc]                          │"
"└──────────────────────────────────────┘"
